    {
      "id": "python-concurrency-network-threading-c01",
      "type": "code",
      "prompt": "读取线程数 n，必须为 0 到 8（含端点）的整数。创建 n 个本地线程，每个线程在同一把 Lock 保护下将共享计数器加一；启动全部线程后 join 全部，再输出计数。0 输出 0。非法输入无输出，退出码 1。禁止用 sleep 猜测完成时间，不进行网络操作。支架已验证 n。",
      "starter_code": "import sys\ntext = sys.stdin.read().strip()\ntry:\n    n = int(text)\nexcept ValueError:\n    raise SystemExit(1)\nimport threading\nif not 0 <= n <= 8:\n    raise SystemExit(1)\n# 按题面实现本课操作\n",
      "visible_tests": [
        "输入 '2'，输出 '2\\n'，退出码 0。",
        "输入 '3'，输出 '3\\n'，退出码 0。"
      ],
      "experience_points": 15,
      "private": {
        "reference_solution": "import sys\ntext = sys.stdin.read().strip()\ntry:\n    n = int(text)\nexcept ValueError:\n    raise SystemExit(1)\nimport threading\nif not 0 <= n <= 8:\n    raise SystemExit(1)\nstate = {\"value\": 0}\nlock = threading.Lock()\ndef increment():\n    with lock:\n        state[\"value\"] += 1\nthreads = [threading.Thread(target=increment) for _ in range(n)]\nfor thread in threads:\n    thread.start()\nfor thread in threads:\n    thread.join()\nprint(state[\"value\"])\n",
        "hidden_tests": [
          "检查题面规定的有效边界和失败行为。",
          "输出格式、类型和顺序以题面约定为准。"
        ],
